id: pm-gh1429
title: Exact-tag recovery must preserve the complete reviewed release-control import closure
description: "GitHub #1429 and scheduled Auto Release run 37911930520 / downstream Release 37911971128 failed at the preserved package artifact gate: package-distribution.mjs imports ../temp-lifecycle.mjs, but the recovery workflow copies only four flat control files. Preserve reviewed controls with their full local module/assets closure and layout before any tag checkout. Prove executable recovery from a foreign directory while retaining immutable tagged build inputs and public-artifact publication refusal."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: acceptance,"area:release","horizon:current",regression
created_at: "2026-10-09T10:50:57.951Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-09T12:10:30.186Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-09T11:59:28.137Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-09T11:59:28.137Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Preserved reviewed controls execute from an unrelated root with all transitive local imports and required assets; recovery preserves directory topology and continues to use the reviewed artifact budgets; missing dependencies and unsafe source selections fail visibly; exact published tag recovery verifies without republishing or moving the immutable tag; hosted and local executable controls catch the original missing temp-lifecycle failure
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: high
resolution: "Workflow preservation retains scripts/release topology, temporary lifecycle and cleanup dependencies, reviewed budget and controls outside the source checkout. An executable workflow test packs an unrelated temporary workspace through real npm and detects physical removal of a required local import. Registered recurrence protection and justified typed links accompany the change; the prose-gap ceiling tightens 1236 to 1233 with 1233-pass/1234-fail controls."
expected_result: Current reviewed controls execute independently of tagged source and immutable public versions are accepted without republishing.
actual_result: "Real foreign-workspace npm artifact packing passed and the missing-module negative control failed with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND. Owner-linked workflow suites, full exact coverage, artifact budget, graph composition at 1233, integrity, source assurance, context and packed consumers pass. The failed aggregate graph receipt remains retained; corrected graph and downstream mutation gates passed separately. Hosted recovery and GitHub Release advertisement are verified after main receives the reviewed controls."
